  "implementation_review": [
    "Every configured source and input was rehashed. Actual reused native transport control report and owner were read; the frozen helper validates exact roundtrip native bytes, Boolean/signed domains, an empty linear equation, an integer above binary64 precision and rejection of an invalid variable index.",
    "The accepted parent model is decompressed only after its archive hash is checked; its exact raw hash/bytes bind the previous independent model cold and both family authorities.",
    "Source checks parent variable/row counts, Boolean edge and selector domains, literal edge names and endpoint identities, proposal uniqueness/order, complete unmatched-proposal coverage, and every four-row original witness origin.",
    "Appending creates only linear rows, preserves the exact complete parent protobuf after removal of appended rows, and also requires the original raw model to be a complete byte prefix. No variable, objective, hint, assumption or symmetry restriction is added.",
    "The frozen base transport creates a CpModel, performs public text parsing and native validation, exports the model and compares every raw byte to the expected protobuf. It constructs no CpSolver and makes no optimizer call.",
    "The owner uses the hash-pinned supervisor whose CHILD_EXITED status requires returncode zero; the owner also checks returncode, the fixed terminal status and the full 120-second deadline."
  ],
  "independent_complete_native_append_replay_required": true,
  "main_run_acceptance_granted": false,
