  "proof_review": [
    "The complete accepted three-exterior replay supplies every selected one-edge and path proposal, in exactly the saved sorted order, with all six-site forced-nonedge proofs and native redundancy receipts already checked.",
    "The one-edge row y_e+x_third<=1 uses domain [0,1]; its lower endpoint follows from the two Boolean nonnegative variables. The path row y_e1+y_e2-x_center<=0 uses domain [-1,0]; its lower endpoint follows from x_center<=1 and nonnegative edges.",
    "Every original four-exterior row is reused with both negative center coefficients and every accepted positive edge term. Domain [-2,0] adds no restriction beyond the proved upper bound and Boolean variable domains.",
    "The failed four-cold outer owner remains explicitly failed. Acceptance requires the successful frozen child report, independent metadata-resolution receipt, copied successful supervision and root acceptance; reference comparisons normalize path/SHA identities and validate supplied byte counts.",
    "The optional Boolean shortening is excluded by the bound family decision. All 72,468 original four-exterior rows and all 1,250,496 of their terms are retained."
  ],
